# No commit or PR attribution

Never add attribution trailers or co-author lines to git commits, pull requests, or commit message templates. That includes:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Co-authored-by:` for any AI / agent identity
- `Made-with: Cursor` / `Made with Cursor`
- Any similar Cursor, Claude, Codex, or agent attribution footer

Commit messages should contain only the human-authored subject/body the user requested. Do not append trailers after the message.
